(# Remote Work Policy) Tj
T*
T*
(1. Scope) Tj
T*
(This policy applies to employees approved for remote or hybrid work. Remote work) Tj
T*
(must support customer commitments, team collaboration, and information security.) Tj
T*
T*
(6. Core Collaboration Hours) Tj
T*
(Remote employees must be reachable during core collaboration hours from 10:00 AM) Tj
T*
(to 3:00 PM Mountain Time, Monday through Thursday, excluding company holidays.) Tj
T*
(Departments may publish additional coverage windows for customer-facing teams.) Tj
T*
T*
(7. Work Location And Security) Tj
T*
(Employees must work from a secure location, use company-managed devices, and) Tj
T*
(connect through approved network controls when required. Confidential work) Tj
T*
(should not be performed where screens or conversations can be observed by) Tj
T*
(unauthorized people.) Tj
T*
T*
(8. Tools And Records) Tj
T*
(Employees must use approved communication, ticketing, document, and storage) Tj
T*
(systems for company work. Policy decisions, approvals, and official records must) Tj
T*
(be captured in the appropriate system of record, not only in chat.) Tj
T*
T*
